                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201510/2015100910572129.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">他，研制出了世界上最精准、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">能聆听<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="http://tech.qq.com/all/twht.htm" target=_blank><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none"><SPAN lang=EN-US>宇宙</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>交响乐的</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">原子钟；<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=3>他，取得了光频测量领域的突破性成就、被国际同行公认为光学领域的伟大人物之一；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=3>他，被世界著名的诺奖预测机构汤森·路透集团预测为<SPAN lang=EN-US>2015</SPAN>年诺贝尔物理学奖的热门候选人……<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=3>他——<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=3>叶军。绍兴一中<SPAN lang=EN-US>1982</SPAN>届初三（<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>）班、<SPAN lang=EN-US>1985</SPAN>届高三（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）班毕业生。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 6pt 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm" align=center><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN>用原子钟聆听</SPAN><SPAN><A href="http://tech.qq.com/all/twht.htm" target=_blank><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-DECORATION: none; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; text-underline: none; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><SPAN lang=EN-US>宇宙</SPAN></SPAN></A>的交响乐<o:p></o:p></SPAN></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">2015</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">年，十月金秋，国庆佳节。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>在举国上下欢庆祖国母亲<SPAN lang=EN-US>66</SPAN>岁生日之际，全世界的注意力却转到了瑞典斯德哥尔摩的诺贝尔奖颁奖台——<SPAN lang=EN-US>2015</SPAN>年诺贝尔奖的大幕已经在徐徐开启了！<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>对于今年的诺贝尔物理学奖得主，世界著名的诺奖预测机构——汤森<SPAN lang=EN-US>·</SPAN>路透集团预测的热门候选人是美籍华人物理学家、被国际同行公认为光学领域的伟大人物之一的叶军。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P><?xml:namespace prefix = v ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" /><v:shapetype id=_x0000_t75 coordsize="21600,21600" o:spt="75" o:preferrelative="t" path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" filled="f" stroked="f"><v:stroke joinstyle="miter"></v:stroke><v:formulas><v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 0 1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @6 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @8 21600 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @10 21600 0"></v:f></v:formulas><v:path o:extrusionok="f" gradientshapeok="t" o:connecttype="rect"></v:path><o:lock v:ext="edit" aspectratio="t"></o:lock></v:shapetype>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><v:shape id=_x0000_s1026 style="MARGIN-TOP: 34.7pt; Z-INDEX: 1; LEFT: 0px; MARGIN-LEFT: 0px; WIDTH: 153pt; POSITION: absolute; HEIGHT: 86.3pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left" type="#_x0000_t75"><FONT size=3><v:imagedata src="file:///C:\DOCUME~1\ADMINI~1\LOCALS~1\Temp\msohtml1\01\clip_image001.jpg" o:title="118774492"></v:imagedata><?xml:namespace prefix = w ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" /><w:wrap type="square"></w:wrap></FONT></v:shape><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">叶军，男，浙江绍兴人，现为美国国家科学院院士、著名物理学家约翰·霍尔的学生，供职于美国科罗拉多大学联合研究中心。<SPAN lang=EN-US>2005</SPAN>年，霍尔凭借<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>飞秒光梳<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>技术实现了激光频率的直接绝对测量而获得了诺贝尔物理学奖，叶军主持的光梳技术研究工作正是其中的重要而关键的部分，这项成果后来被国际科学界视为光频测量领域的突破性成就。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-no-proof: yes">叶军因此荣获了</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-no-proof: yes"><FONT face="Times New Roman">2007</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-no-proof: yes">年度卡尔</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-no-proof: yes"><FONT face="Times New Roman">·</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-no-proof: yes">蔡司研究奖、</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-no-proof: yes"><FONT face="Times New Roman">2007</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-no-proof: yes">年度拉比奖，这些都是世界光学领域最著名的奖项。同时，叶军也被国际同行公认为是光学领域的伟大人物之一。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">年轻的叶军，此时的他意气风发、踌躇满志。</SPAN></FONT></P></SPAN>
<P align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201510/2015100910575253.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0></P>
<P align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201510/2015100910580625.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">1999</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">8</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">月，完<?xml:namespace prefix = st1 ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /><st1:PersonName ProductID="成" w:st="on">成</st1:PersonName>博士后研究的叶军，回到了美国</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">JILA</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">。导师霍尔对他很器重，在退休后竟将实验室交由叶军主持。叶军夜以继日地忘我工作，渐渐在</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">光梳技术研究领域取得了突出成绩，<SPAN lang=EN-US>2005</SPAN>年，正是其主持的光梳技术研究成果助力导师获得了诺贝尔物理学奖。如今，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">叶军的实验室里有着世界上最精确的激光，能操作世界上最小的人造物体的工具，也是宇宙中温度最低的地方。正因如此，他的实验室吸引了世界上很多著名科学家前来合作研究，包括曾经的导师霍尔。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">2007</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年下半年，利用</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">飞秒光梳</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">技术的每</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">7000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">万年仅误差</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">秒的锶原子钟，终于被叶军成功研制。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><v:shapetype id=_x0000_t75 coordsize="21600,21600" o:spt="75" o:preferrelative="t" path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" filled="f" stroked="f"><v:stroke joinstyle="miter"></v:stroke><v:formulas><v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 0 1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @6 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @8 21600 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @10 21600 0"></v:f></v:formulas><v:path o:extrusionok="f" gradientshapeok="t" o:connecttype="rect"></v:path><o:lock v:ext="edit" aspectratio="t"></o:lock></v:shapetype><v:shape id=_x0000_s1026 style="MARGIN-TOP: 52.35pt; Z-INDEX: 1; LEFT: 0px; MARGIN-LEFT: 243pt; WIDTH: 171pt; POSITION: absolute; HEIGHT: 95.85pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left" type="#_x0000_t75"><FONT size=3><v:imagedata src="file:///C:\DOCUME~1\ADMINI~1\LOCALS~1\Temp\msohtml1\01\clip_image001.jpg" o:title="118774312"></v:imagedata><w:wrap type="square"></w:wrap></FONT></v:shape><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">据悉，国际上第一台铯原子钟于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">1952</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年制成成功，其精度为每</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">3000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">万年误差</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">秒。而叶军研制成功的铯原子钟，每</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">7000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">万年仅误差</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">秒，其精度已经大大领先世界。但叶军并不满足于此，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">2015</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年，能够检测精确到</SPAN><st1:chmetcnv w:st="on" UnitName="厘米" SourceValue="2" HasSpace="False" Negative="False" NumberType="1" TCSC="0"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">厘米</SPAN></st1:chmetcnv><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">的海拔高度变化、未来或可用于探测暗物质的原子钟，又被叶军成功研制。如果说，五年前的那个钟，只能够检测出<st1:chmetcnv w:st="on" UnitName="英尺" SourceValue="1" HasSpace="False" Negative="False" NumberType="3" TCSC="1">一英尺</st1:chmetcnv>（约</SPAN><st1:chmetcnv w:st="on" UnitName="厘米" SourceValue="30" HasSpace="False" Negative="False" NumberType="1" TCSC="0"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">30</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">厘米</SPAN></st1:chmetcnv><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">）高度变化的时间差的话，那么新的时钟则要灵敏、精确得多。“现在，即使是</SPAN><st1:chmetcnv w:st="on" UnitName="厘米" SourceValue="2" HasSpace="False" Negative="False" NumberType="1" TCSC="0"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">厘米</SPAN></st1:chmetcnv><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">的变化也能反映在时钟上。”叶军说。制造一个如此精确的时钟似乎有些小题大做，但它可以改善我们对地球形状的认识，帮助制定时间和空间的基本法规，并为暗物质的探测提供了一个新的途径。时钟越精确，这些优势就越加凸显。“如果我们能制造一个精确</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">1000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">倍的时钟，就可以聆听</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="http://tech.qq.com/all/twht.htm" target=_blank><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-DECORATION: none; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; text-underline: none; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><SPAN lang=EN-US>宇宙</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">的交响乐了。”叶军说，“比如，当一个遥远的星系爆发时，你可以通过时钟感受到宇宙时间的震荡。”</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-no-proof: yes">美国科学院院士、加州大学伯克利分校教授沈元壤评价说：“光梳技术的突破是一个诺贝尔奖级的工作，叶军是非常优秀的世界级物理学家，是该领域前沿的领军人物。”</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-no-proof: yes"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">这使叶军再次名声大振，也成为</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">2015</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年诺</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">贝尔物理学</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">奖的热门人选。</SPAN></FONT></P><BR>
<P align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201510/2015100910584224.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 6pt 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm" align=center><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">自古英雄出少年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">1967</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">11</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">月，叶军出生于绍兴市区一个知识分子家庭。父母都是大学毕业生，叶军自幼聪颖过人。三四岁时，广播里经常播放样板戏，他一下子就听会了。原绍兴油车弄（现在的城市广场原址）老邻居还记得这样一幕：盛夏傍晚，小叶军站在竹榻上，有板有眼地唱上一段杨子荣唱段，一词不差，韵味十足。等初识字后，叶军就非常喜欢读书，把家里的几大柜藏书都看过了一遍。他常说，书籍里有丰富的知识，有做人的道理。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><v:shapetype id=_x0000_t75 coordsize="21600,21600" o:spt="75" o:preferrelative="t" path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" filled="f" stroked="f"><v:stroke joinstyle="miter"></v:stroke><v:formulas><v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 0 1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @6 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @8 21600 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @10 21600 0"></v:f></v:formulas><v:path o:extrusionok="f" gradientshapeok="t" o:connecttype="rect"></v:path><o:lock v:ext="edit" aspectratio="t"></o:lock></v:shapetype><v:shape id=_x0000_s1026 style="MARGIN-TOP: 23.4pt; Z-INDEX: 1; LEFT: 0px; MARGIN-LEFT: 9pt; WIDTH: 105.05pt; POSITION: absolute; HEIGHT: 106.7pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left" type="#_x0000_t75"><FONT size=3><v:imagedata src="file:///C:\DOCUME~1\ADMINI~1\LOCALS~1\Temp\msohtml1\01\clip_image001.jpg" o:title="98091306946630950"></v:imagedata><w:wrap type="square"></w:wrap></FONT></v:shape><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">1979</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年，叶军进入绍兴一中就读初中和高中。在这所有着近</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">120</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年历史、倡导“多元开放，兼容并包”办学思想的江南名校里，叶军如鱼得水，如虎添翼，每天在校园里如饥似渴地读书学习，各方面的素质得到了全面快速地提升。六年时间里，他的各科成绩始终遥遥领先，一直位于年段前三之内。据叶军的父亲叶善祥介绍，叶军在学习上肯下苦功，肯动脑子，无论走在哪里，都随带一本字典，或者一小本子，抄录着几个英文单词或数学公式、理化定义等，遇到排队等候时，他就拿出来背诵。“叶军在一中读书期间，勤奋努力，好学上进，各科成绩都很优秀，各方面素质都比较突出，是个非常出色的学生。更难能可贵的是，他为人诚朴，节俭懂事，又肯吃苦、肯钻研。”一提起当年自己的得意门生，原绍兴一中教务主任、高中班主任兼数学老师蒋为瑛就赞不绝口。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">1985</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年，高三毕业之际，叶军因各科成绩优异，没有参加高考就被上海交通大学保送录取。在选择专业时，他毫不犹豫地选择了自己最喜爱的物理专业，成为交大物理试点班的一员，从此开启了他今后璀璨多姿的物理人生。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT size=3>“选择自己最喜欢和最优秀的物理专业，成就今后灿烂的人生梦想。可以说叶军今日的巨大成就，早在一中读书时就已经埋下很好的伏笔了，他在物理方面确实有潜力、有特长。”这是绍兴一中叶军当初的两位物理老师的共同感慨。</FONT></SPAN><BR></P>
<P align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201510/2015100910590848.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0></P><BR><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><v:shapetype id=_x0000_t75 coordsize="21600,21600" o:spt="75" o:preferrelative="t" path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" filled="f" stroked="f"><v:stroke joinstyle="miter"></v:stroke><v:formulas><v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 0 1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @6 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @8 21600 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @10 21600 0"></v:f></v:formulas><v:path o:extrusionok="f" gradientshapeok="t" o:connecttype="rect"></v:path><o:lock v:ext="edit" aspectratio="t"></o:lock></v:shapetype><v:shape id=_x0000_s1026 style="MARGIN-TOP: -9.15pt; Z-INDEX: 1; LEFT: 0px; MARGIN-LEFT: 252pt; WIDTH: 153pt; POSITION: absolute; HEIGHT: 102.75pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left" type="#_x0000_t75"><v:imagedata src="file:///C:\DOCUME~1\ADMINI~1\LOCALS~1\Temp\msohtml1\01\clip_image001.jpg" o:title="8241306946630935"></v:imagedata><w:wrap type="square"></w:wrap></v:shape><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>1989</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>22</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">岁的叶军从上海交通大学物理专业毕业后，赴美国新墨西哥大学攻读硕士学位。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>1994</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年，叶军进入美国科罗拉多大学攻读物理博士学位，师从著名实验物理学家约翰</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>·</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">霍尔教授。三年后，叶军一鼓作气，进入加州理工学院做博士后研究，他的导师吉夫</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>·</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">金博教授则是一位伟大的思想家，不断向他灌输科研创新的重要性。　</SPAN></FONT></P></FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></SPAN></FONT></SPAN>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT size=3>从此，叶军站在两位巨人的肩上，汲取着前辈科学家的知识精华和优秀品质，他的羽翼渐趋丰满。</FONT></SPAN></P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 7.8pt 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm" align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></SPAN></FONT></B> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 7.8pt 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm" align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></SPAN></FONT></B> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 7.8pt 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm" align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">“院士学生”中的一中骄傲</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">陈建功、潘家铮、陈翰馥、徐</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">扬生、蒋梦麟、夏丏尊、许寿裳、胡鸿烈……<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>在绍兴一中百二十年的办学历程中，上述这些如雷贯耳的学子名字，一看就让人心生敬畏。他们当中，既有获得国家最高荣誉的两院院士，也有执掌北大近三十年的著名校长；既有驰骋文坛的文学大家；也有扬名香江的权威律师。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>他们，是一中培养的近五万名学生中的杰出代表；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>他们，成就了一中昨天、今天和明天的骄傲；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>他们，筑成了一中头顶上的灿烂星空，光耀万丈、千秋留芳……<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">绍兴市第一中学，这所</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">绍兴地区历史最悠久、影响力最大的学校，自<SPAN lang=EN-US>1897</SPAN>年越地乡贤徐树兰捐资创办以来，至今已经横跨了整整三个世纪。这所</SPAN><st1:PersonName ProductID="蔡元培" w:st="on"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">蔡元培</SPAN></st1:PersonName><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">先生担任过校长，<st1:PersonName ProductID="鲁迅" w:st="on">鲁迅</st1:PersonName>先生担任过教务主任，杜亚泉、刘大白、徐锡麟等一大批越中名士也曾先后任教于斯的江南名校，在</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">经历了百二十年的风雨春秋和岁月积淀后，已经形成了</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">自己“多元开放，兼容并包” 的独特办学理念和个性特色。这种理念和个性积淀为一中的文化精神传统，在“一中人”身上血脉相承，使得百年老校青春依旧、辉煌永存、名人辈出。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">一百二十年来，绍兴一中集稽山镜水之灵气，蕴越乡名士之精神，以激荡百年的历史文化，培养身心健康、精神自由、素质全面、特长发展的各种创新型人才，通过搭建多种形式、多种途径的成才路径，使一中学子呈现出一种朝气蓬勃、大气从容、创新创造的气度，并在今后的人生中快速地“成人、成才、成就”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">。办学至今，已经</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">为社会培养了十八位两院院士和其他诸如著名历史地理学家、浙江大学<st1:PersonName ProductID="终身" w:st="on">终身</st1:PersonName>教授陈桥驿在内的无数专家学者、社会名流。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>叶军，便是新一代一中人中的佼佼者和典型代表之一。</P></FONT></SPAN></SPAN>
<P align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201510/2015100911000242.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0></P><BR><v:shape id=_x0000_s1026 style="MARGIN-TOP: 7.8pt; Z-INDEX: 1; LEFT: 0px; MARGIN-LEFT: 0px; WIDTH: 150pt; POSITION: absolute; HEIGHT: 98.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left" type="#_x0000_t75"><FONT size=3><v:imagedata src="file:///C:\DOCUME~1\ADMINI~1\LOCALS~1\Temp\msohtml1\01\clip_image001.jpg" o:title="M000B3ECggSBFYRCPWAA87WAADw3F2Jdh496"></v:imagedata><w:wrap type="square"></w:wrap></FONT></v:shape><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>这，是位于落基山下，美国科罗拉多大学美丽校园里的联合研究中心。这个看上去并不起眼的小楼，却曾经产生出世界上最低的温度、也产生出世界上最精准的钟。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>这座虽然简朴却藏龙卧虎的小楼，古朴、厚重、大气、深邃……亦如绍兴一中的百年校园。“多元开放，兼容并包”，正是基于这样的办学理念，百年一中才能人才辈出、风光无限、老当益壮。虽然这中间，有过曲折，有过坎坷，甚至还有过流亡办学的血泪历史，但正是经历了风雨，彩虹才如此光耀；正是承受了寒冰，梅香才这么沁人。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">虽然<SPAN lang=EN-US>2015</SPAN>年的</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">诺</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">贝尔物理学</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">奖最终被他人摘得，叶军遗憾地失之交臂。但我们有理由相信，这只是黎明前的短暂黑暗，风雨后的晴空，更能万里澄澈。我们期盼着一定会有那么一天，叶军会站在</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">瑞典斯德哥尔摩的诺贝尔奖颁奖台上，微笑世界。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>那时，全世界、全中国，还有故乡的绍兴、母校的绍兴一中，都会为你鼓掌喝彩，骄傲自豪。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                                                         </SPAN></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3></FONT></SPAN> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=right><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>（朱水军）</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"> </P><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR>
    
